# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERVER-ONLY SECRET. Never rename this to a VITE_* variable.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client JavaScript bundle,
# which would expose your API key to every visitor. This key is read
# ONLY by the server:
#   • functions/api/generate.ts   (Cloudflare Pages production)
#   • vite.config.ts              (local dev middleware)
#
# Local development : put your key in .env (gitignored)
# Production        : Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables
#                     → set AICREDITS_API_KEY for BOTH Production and Preview
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AICREDITS_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the image model used for mascot generation.
# Defaults to google/gemini-2.5-flash-image
# AICREDITS_IMAGE_MODEL=

# Optional: override the vision model used to describe the subject.
# Defaults to google/gemini-2.5-flash
# AICREDITS_VISION_MODEL=
